Package: omnissa-envoy-lb
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Szymon Frankiewicz <szymonfrankiewicz@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, ca-certificates, curl, gnupg, iproute2, iputils-ping, iputils-arping, bind9-dnsutils | dnsutils, netplan.io, openssl, jq, nftables | ufw, systemd
Suggests: envoy
Homepage: https://github.com/franekSoftSF/omnissa-envoy-lb
Description: Omnissa Tunnel/SEG load balancer based on Envoy Proxy
 Installer and configurator for an Envoy-based Layer 4 load balancer for
 Omnissa Tunnel and Secure Email Gateway (TLS passthrough, SNI routing on a
 shared VIP, TCP/UDP listeners, health checks, nftables/ufw firewall,
 monitoring, backup and rollback).
 .
 The package ships the tool only. Envoy Proxy (apt.envoyproxy.io), the
 Python virtual environment and the systemd service are set up by
 "omnissa-lb-install".
